  "details": "SDK Version: 3.5.2\n\nMinimal reproducible example\n\nScript: Attached image.\n\nScene: Attached image.\n\n* MainCamera - no Audio Listener\n\n* VRCWorld\n\n* Listener - AudioListener, AudioLowPassFilter\n\n* SwitchObject - Above script (target = Listener), BoxCollider\n\nWith this scene, you can set the cutoff frequency in ClientSim.\n\nHowever, it won't work in \"Build & Test\".\n\nIs this an expected behavior?\n\nUPDATE:\n\nAfter additional investigation, it appears that this occurs only with AudioLowPassFilter attached to AudioListener.\n\nAudioLowPassFilter attached to AudioSource is able to change the cutoff frequency.",
